into one candle 0.11 workspace, GPU-resident Q8_0 weights and Q8 GEMV/GEMM
kernels for Vulkan (candle-core/src/vulkan_backend/qgpu.rs), Vulkan device and
queue selection, ROCm memory-pool and runtime-cache management, and related
fixes. Modified files are distributed under the Apache License 2.0; the
third-party notices above continue to apply to the portions they cover.

The fused attention and TurboQuant code (candle-core/src/accel/,
candle-core/kernels/accel_common.h, flash_attn_impl.h, turbo_quant_impl.h,
candle-core/src/*_backend/accel.rs, candle-nn/src/flash_attn.rs,
candle-nn/src/turbo_quant.rs, candle-flash-attn/) was written for this project
and implements published algorithms; it contains no code from the projects
that describe them:
  - FlashAttention v1 / v2 / v3, Tri Dao et al.
    https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention
  - TurboQuant, Amir Zandieh et al. (reference implementation:
    https://github.com/abdelstark/turboquant), and QJL
  - OCP Microscaling (MX) formats v1.0 and NVIDIA NVFP4
